                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wacu kumae: Mi gondri adek mi Moab, eyo, mir ang’wen, abiloko masendine cen ungo; kum ewang’u cogo mir ubimo mir Edom udoko ni nunu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento abioro mac wi Moab, man ebiwang’u udi mi ker mi Kerioth; man Moab bitho ku yakni, ku kok, man ku badwal mir agwara; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man abikabu japoklembe kud i kinde, man abinego judongomawijone karacelo kude, Yehova wacu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.2.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
